+## Aspects
+
+Aspects group two or more traits into one unit with unified operations. Use them when the same traits are always listed and merged together.
+
+```typescript
+import { createAspect } from 'koota'
+
+const Movement = createAspect(Position, Velocity) // Position {x,y}, Velocity {dx,dy}
+
+Movement.traits // [Position, Velocity] (nested aspects flatten)
+Movement.schema // { x, y, dx, dy } (merged, overlapping fields throw)
+
+// Entity ops treat the aspect as all constituents at once
+entity.add(Movement({ x: 10, dy: 1 })) // Adds only missing constituents, values by field
+entity.has(Movement) // True only when every constituent is present
+entity.get(Movement) // Merged object, or undefined if any constituent missing
+entity.set(Movement, { x: 20, dx: 2 }) // Distributes fields with per-trait change detection
+entity.remove(Movement) // Removes all constituents
+
+// Queries require all constituents and deliver one merged object
+world.query(Movement).updateEach(([m]) => {
+  m.x += m.dx
+})
+
+// Compose with modifiers
+world.query(Not(Movement)) // Missing at least one constituent
+world.query(Added(Movement)) // Transition to all-present
+world.query(Removed(Movement)) // Transition from all-present
+world.query(Changed(Movement)) // Any constituent changed while all present
+
+// Events fire on completeness transitions
+world.onAdd(Movement, (entity) => {}) // Incomplete -> complete
+world.onRemove(Movement, (entity) => {}) // Complete -> incomplete
+world.onChange(Movement, (entity) => {}) // Any constituent changed while complete
+```
+
+Constituents must be SoA or tag traits with unique field names. Relations and AoS traits throw at creation time.
+
 ## Basic usage
 
 ```typescript
