@@ -55,6 +55,18 @@ world.query(Or(IsPlayer, IsEnemy))
 world.query(Position, Not(Velocity), Or(IsPlayer, IsEnemy))
 ```
 
+Aspects (created with `createAspect`) work as query parameters and compose with all modifiers. An aspect requires all of its constituent traits and delivers one merged data object per entity in `readEach`/`updateEach`.
+
+```typescript
+const Movement = createAspect(Position, Velocity)
+
+world.query(Movement) // Requires Position AND Velocity, state is { x, y, dx, dy }
+world.query(Not(Movement)) // Missing at least one constituent
+world.query(Added(Movement)) // Transition to all-constituents-present
+world.query(Removed(Movement)) // Transition from all-constituents-present
+world.query(Changed(Movement)) // Any constituent changed while all present
+```
+
 ## Tracking modifiers
 
 Track structural and data changes. Each tracking modifier must be created as a unique instance.
